            <div xml:id="d534">

                <pb facs="0861" n="725" xml:id="pg725"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">723.2515/3254: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Moore</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-01-22T18:00:00-05:00">January 22, 1929—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 7:20 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>8. My 6, January 20, 11 a.m. The engineers will not return to Lima until February
                    6. Their preliminary report will probably be ready for presentation by February
                    9.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
